dy true (and does not clear occupied?). Wait loading effect: origin_node_occupied ?origin_node. Unload effect: origin_node_ready ?origin_node. It does not remove origin_node_occupied. So after load then unload, we have both origin_node_occupied and origin_node_ready true? That seems odd but allowed. Goal wants both occupied and ready true, so that matches.

